WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,080
You can't finish such a big one by yourself

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,080
The weather is so hot

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,480
It's a waste if it's broken

4
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:06,880
What's wrong with dividing us a little bit?

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,280
After all, everyone is sad together

6
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,680
I can smoke the liver if I can’t finish it.

7
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,280
You can change things and feed the dog

8
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,680
It's all my business how to deal with it

9
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,480
When your house is not full

10
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,080
I didn’t see you sharing a room with me either.

11
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:20,200
Why didn't you think of everyone when you drove me away?

12
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,880
He's right

13
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,080
I want something from him in the future

14
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:27,660
Just follow his rules

15
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,860
Sister Lu

16
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:32,500
Have you ever thought about seeking refuge

17
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,900
If you hadn't sprained your foot today,

18
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,100
Caught it long ago

19
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,100
It's reasonable for your share to be smaller, right?

20
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,900
Everyone contributes when catching a rabbit

21
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:40,500
The injured person will have his meal deducted instead.

22
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,500
What kind of rules is this?

23
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,900
I just said contribution

24
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,900
See it?

25
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,700
Just one less bite of meat today

26
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:46,700
What about next time

27
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:47,900
What do you want to say
